  "_comment": [
    "How each alternate form in data/pokemon resolves to a PokeAPI entry, for",
    "tools/download_base_stats.py.",
    "",
    "Anything not named here is looked up by its dex number, which returns the",
    "species' default form -- correct for every plain species file.",
    "",
    "variants: forms that really do have their own stat spread. The value is the",
    "  PokeAPI slug (https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon/<slug>/).",
    "cosmetic: forms that are a costume or a re-skin over the base species and so",
    "  inherit its stats. Listed rather than omitted so the fetcher can tell an",
    "  intentional inherit from a form somebody forgot to classify -- an unlisted",
    "  form is reported as a warning instead of silently taking base stats."
  ],

